{"id":"vod_sn_37678","vodId":"37678","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"本田小狼与我","name_cn":"本田小狼与我","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1b32e561ef2213162e64cae830f917c3.jpg"},"summary":"小熊（夜道雪 配音）是就读山梨县北杜市一所高中的女孩，性格内向的她在学校里沉默寡言，没有朋友，一直孤身一人。回到家中，小熊面对的也是空空的房间，没有任何亲人的存在。就是这样一个孤独的少女，在一次偶然中买下了一辆中古摩托车，这辆摩托车的存在很快就成为了小熊的心灵寄托，只要骑上它，小熊便感到自己是自由的，内心会绽放出无数小小的烟花。　　礼子（七濑彩夏 配音）是班级里出了名的高岭之花，总是一副拒人于千里之外的样子，某天，礼子突然找到小熊，说希望能够看一看她的车。与此同时，惠庭椎（日冈夏美 配音）和惠庭慧海等人也因为各种机缘巧合而和小熊走到了一起，不知道从哪一天开始，孤独的生活告别了小熊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/THRkUGDRdA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8cp1xSqY1B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fEVkviFVcJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LKP6uXxb411/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UCn5CbekrX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3Hah0jjJWD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AS54DAgJT51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fKJPyKySiG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W2MsnWCj5q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nwyJ13qCb91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7M0MDegeiA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q5jmBWW0Qk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.933Z"}